notes_text:
w.e.f. 1 May 2022- for tariff item 5503 11 00 and the entries relating thereto, the following shall be substituted, namely:-
“5503 11 -- Of aramids:
5503 11 10 --- Aramid Flame Retardant Fibre kg. 2.5% -
5503 11 20 --- Para- aramid Fibre kg. 2.5% - 
5503 11 90 --- Other kg. 5% -”;
- for tariff item 5503 19 00 and the entries relating thereto, the following shall be substituted, namely:-
“5503 19 - - Other: 
5503 19 10 - - - Nylon Staple Fibre kg. 2.5% - 
5503 19 20 - - - Nylon Anti Static Staple Fibre kg. 2.5% - 
5503 19 30 - - - Nylon 66 fibre conforming to IS 13464 kg. 2.5% - 
5503 19 90 - - - Other kg. 5% -”;
- against tariff item 5503 20 00, substituted by “5%”;
- for tariff item 5503 30 00 and the entries relating thereto, the following shall be substituted, namely:-
“5503 30 - Acrylic or modacrylic:
5503 30 10 --- Pre Oxidised Fibre, conforming to IS 17308 kg. 2.5% -
5503 30 90 --- Other kg. 5% -”;
- against tariff items 5503 40 00, 5503 90 10 and 5503 90 20, substituted by “5%”;
- after tariff item 5503 90 20 and the entries relating thereto, the following shall be inserted, namely: -
“5503 90 30 --- Ultra high molecular weight poly ethylene staple fibre conforming to ASTM F2848 kg. 5% -”;
- against tariff item 5503 90 90, the entry substituted by “5%”;
[Clause 98(b) of Finance Act 2022]
Schedule Rate of Basic Customs Duty Raised to 20% from 10% by Ntfn 80-Customs/2017 dated 27.10.2017.
IGST on All goods in this heading by SNo 344 in Sch I of Ntfn 09-IGST/17.09.2025

